      <div type="clause" n="74">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 74</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CXVIII} Gif ðeowweahl Engliscne monnan ofslihð, þonne sceal se ðe hine ah weorpan hine to honda hlaforde ⁊ mægum oððe LX sciƚƚ gesellan wið his feore.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a Welsh slave kills an English man, then the owner shall turn him over to the [slain man’s] lord and kin or pay 60 shillings for his life.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a Welsh slave slays an Englishman, his owner shall hand him over to the dead man's lord and kinsmen, or purchase his life for 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif þeowweahl Engliscne mon ofslihþ, þonne sceal se þe hine ah weorpan hine to honda hlaforde ⁊ magum oþþe LX scll' gesyllan wið his feore.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
